NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000067 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000068 "=head1 SEE ALSO"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000069 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000070 "L<JSON> should also encode to a single-line string, but some data structures"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000071 "(cyclical, contains globs or other special Perl data) cannot be encoded out of"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000072 "the box to JSON."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000073 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000074 "L<Data::Dumper::OneLine> strives to do the same for L<Data::Dumper>, but last"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000075 "time I tried it (at v0.05) it's still buggy."
